# MASTER BUILD PROMPT — CIVICFIX
## Smart Citizen Issue Reporting & Resolution Management Platform

Act as a senior full-stack engineer, civic technology architect, database engineer, and premium SaaS UI/UX designer.

Build a complete, functional web application named **CivicFix**.

**Tagline: Report It. Track It. Fix It.**

CivicFix is a digital civic issue reporting and resolution platform connecting citizens, administrators, and field workers.

Citizens can report public infrastructure and neighbourhood problems with photographs and location details. Administrators can review complaints, identify duplicates, assign workers, manage priorities, and monitor resolutions. Field workers can view assigned tasks, update progress, and submit completion evidence.

The product should be suitable for a college campus, residential community, or local civic organization.

IMPORTANT:
Build a complete working application, not just a static UI prototype. Every major feature must connect to real database operations.

Do not use fake live complaint data in the actual workspace.

